sequenceDiagram
  participant Game
  participant Connection
  participant Runtime as Room runtime
  participant Profile
  participant DB as Database
  participant Publisher
  Game->>Connection: Game-host packet
  Connection->>Runtime: Packet plus receive timestamp
  Runtime->>Profile: Capture receipt context
  Runtime->>Runtime: Update roster and transfer state
  Runtime->>Profile: Deliver confirmed packet or transfer event
  Profile->>DB: Persist result or tournament event
  Profile-->>Publisher: Publish accepted standings or status
  Publisher-->>Game: Send bounded packet updates
